        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "[...] I try to ask the questions so that at some point there is some kind of shift in consciousness. It is planting the seed of a majestic tree. I look for every way to speed up this change, but it is a structural, cultural, slow change. Little by little it will grow, and it is already sprouting.\" ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "So says Erika Zárate in her interview with Berta Camprubí in the November 2024 issue of El Suplement de La Directa, a print edition entitled \"Dones entre lluites\" (Women among struggles), which gathers experiences of women defending life and land from all over the world.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ]
       },
